        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtkhsv.c"
             line="1504">An HSV color selector can be said to be adjusting if multiple rapid
changes are being made to its value, for example, when the user is
adjusting the value with the mouse. This function queries whether
the HSV color selector is being adjusted or not.</doc>
        <source-position filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtkhsv.h" line="97"/>
        <return-value transfer-ownership="none">
          <doc xml:space="preserve"
               filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtkhsv.c"
