              c:identifier="gtk_label_set_markup_with_mnemonic">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtklabel.c"
             line="2423">Parses @str which is marked up with the &lt;link linkend="PangoMarkupFormat"&gt;Pango text markup language&lt;/link&gt;,
setting the label's text and attribute list based on the parse results.
If characters in @str are preceded by an underscore, they are underlined
indicating that they represent a keyboard accelerator called a mnemonic.

The mnemonic key can be used to activate another widget, chosen
automatically, or explicitly using gtk_label_set_mnemonic_widget().</doc>
        <source-position filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtklabel.h" line="130"/>
        <return-value transfer-ownership="none">
