      <method name="remove_tag" c:identifier="gtk_text_buffer_remove_tag">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtktextbuffer.c"
             line="2596">Emits the "remove-tag" signal. The default handler for the signal
