      <virtual-method name="drag_data_received" invoker="drag_data_received">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtktreednd.c"
             line="163">Asks the #GtkTreeDragDest to insert a row before the path @dest,
deriving the contents of the row from @selection_data. If @dest is
outside the tree so that inserting before it is impossible, %FALSE
will be returned. Also, %FALSE may be returned if the new row is
not created for some model-specific reason.  Should robustly handle
a @dest no longer found in the model!</doc>
