      <method name="append" c:identifier="gtk_tree_store_append">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtktreestore.c"
             line="1607">Appends a new row to @tree_store.  If @parent is non-%NULL, then it will append the
new row after the last child of @parent, otherwise it will append a row to
the top level.  @iter will be changed to point to this new row.  The row will
be empty after this function is called.  To fill in values, you need to call
gtk_tree_store_set() or gtk_tree_store_set_value().</doc>
