      <method name="insert_after" c:identifier="gtk_tree_store_insert_after">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtktreestore.c"
             line="1300">Inserts a new row after @sibling.  If @sibling is %NULL, then the row will be
prepended to @parent 's children.  If @parent and @sibling are %NULL, then
the row will be prepended to the toplevel.  If both @sibling and @parent are
set, then @parent must be the parent of @sibling.  When @sibling is set,
@parent is optional.

@iter will be changed to point to this new row.  The row will be empty after
this function is called.  To fill in values, you need to call
gtk_tree_store_set() or gtk_tree_store_set_value().</doc>
        <source-position filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtktreestore.h"
