        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtktreeviewcolumn.c"
             line="1923">Sets the size of the column in pixels.  This is meaningful only if the sizing
type is #GTK_TREE_VIEW_COLUMN_FIXED.  The size of the column is clamped to
the min/max width for the column.  Please note that the min/max width of the
column doesn't actually affect the "fixed_width" property of the widget, just
the actual size when displayed.</doc>
        <source-position filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtktreeviewcolumn.h"
                         line="169"/>
        <return-value transfer-ownership="none">
