      <method name="add_ui" c:identifier="gtk_ui_manager_add_ui" version="2.4">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtkuimanager.c"
             line="1734">Adds a UI element to the current contents of @self.

If @type is %GTK_UI_MANAGER_AUTO, GTK+ inserts a menuitem, toolitem or
separator if such an element can be inserted at the place determined by
@path. Otherwise @type must indicate an element that can be inserted at
the place determined by @path.

If @path points to a menuitem or toolitem, the new element will be inserted
before or after this item, depending on @top.</doc>
        <source-position filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtkuimanager.h"
                         line="138"/>
        <return-value transfer-ownership="none">
          <type name="none" c:type="void"/>
