      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtkvscale.c"
           line="36">The #GtkVScale widget is used to allow the user to select a value using
a vertical slider. To create one, use gtk_hscale_new_with_range().

The position to show the current value, and the number of decimal places
shown can be set using the parent #GtkScale class's functions.</doc>
