             filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtkwindow.c"
             line="2439">By setting the type hint for the window, you allow the window
manager to decorate and handle the window in a way which is
suitable to the function of the window in your application.

This function should be called before the window becomes visible.

gtk_dialog_new_with_buttons() and other convenience functions in GTK+
will sometimes call gtk_window_set_type_hint() on your behalf.</doc>
        <source-position filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtkwindow.h" line="212"/>
