      <doc xml:space="preserve"
           filename="gtk+-2.24.33/gtk/gtktestutils.c"
           line="109">This function will generate keyboard press and release events in
the middle of the first GdkWindow found that belongs to @widget.
For %GTK_NO_WINDOW widgets like GtkButton, this will often be an
input-only event window. For other widgets, this is usually widget-&gt;window.
Certain caveats should be considered when using this function, in
particular because the mouse pointer is warped to the key press
location, see gdk_test_simulate_key() for details.</doc>
